# backup — шаги записи (что показывается — backup.md). Только панель.
# Этап 1 — заметка; этап 2 — Backup: сохранить, список копий, Autosave.
# Копия пишется во временный vault записи. Start over не нажимается: он стирает настройки.
title Backup | Keep your settings as a note in your vault
open Home tasks.md
caret - [ ] #todo #low || Water the plants
stage Save a backup
say Backup: your settings, kept as a note in your vault
settings Advanced
spot Save a backup
pause 1500
click Save a backup
say Pick the tabs to keep, then Save
pause 2500
click Save
pause 1500
stage Restore
say Restore a backup lists them, newest first
click Restore a backup
pause 2500
click Cancel
stage Autosave
say Autosave → on: a fresh copy whenever your settings change
set Autosave = on
caret - [ ] #todo #low || Water the plants
pause 1500
